int cards, feeling cards, the start-middle-finish card, Curio Class's own. Free path: a poem read aloud, a picture card, claps. Once-a-week path: 7 sessions | After unit 5 because changing an element on purpose needs unit 5's paths, levels and speeds; before unit 7 because a remembered sequence to change needs a sequence made here | Candidate: a second starting-point dance with no religious source, for a school that leaves out Revelations | Revelations is set to spirituals, religious songs of Black Americans: the unit names them as songs from Ailey's childhood church and studies how songs sparked moves, with no child asked about faith; the sensitivity agent reads the company's own published words and a museum's page on spirituals first (leave-out line). Chotto Desh: the sensitivity agent reads the artist's published words first; no child is asked about their own family's country. Feeling cards as unit 2. Hazards and controls: as unit 1. Agent reads: sensitivity; safety (moving). |
