| start-middle-finish | New in kindergarten (da-k-form, model_out) | Unit 2: the start shape, the middle moves and the finish shape, on one card | Unit 6 (a told choice, da-g1-form), unit 10 (a central idea in the middle, da-g2-form); every later making day as review |
