| Check | After unit | Check days | Respond days | What it checks |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Year K mid-year (week 18, days 35 and 36) | 2 | 1 | 1 | Samples units 1 and 2 in their own year, as a showing day in groups of five: a new starting-point card danced with a start, middle and finish shape (DA:Cr2.1.Ka, DA:Cr1.1.Ka), traveling then freezing in own space on the drum (DA:Pr5.1.Kb), and walking speed matched to a new drum tempo (DA:Pr4.1.Kb). Unit 2's own end-of-unit record (days 32 and 33) is carried unscored; no starting-point card from unit 2 repeats. Respond on day 36. |
