| Year 1 mid-year (week 17, days 97 and 98) | 6 | 1 | 1 | Samples units 5 and 6, as a showing day: a formation change on the call (DA:Pr5.1.1c), a steady beat kept as the drum changes tempo (DA:Pr4.1.1b), and a new sequence with a start, middle and finish, with one talk item on why one choice was made (DA:Cr2.1.1a). Unit 6's records (days 94 and 95) are carried unscored. Respond on day 98. |
| Year 1 year-end (week 25, days 113 and 114) | 7 | 1 | 1 | Samples units 5 to 7, as a showing day: a sequence with one element changed on purpose (DA:Cr1.1.1b, unit 6), a suggested change tried in the remembered sequence (DA:Cr3.1.1a), and a show item after the group's turn: the repeating move in a short phrase the teacher dances (DA:Re7.1.1a). Unit 7's records (days 110 and 111) are carried unscored. Unit 8 is assessed by its own family showing. Respond on day 114. |
