model_in      : 
model_out     : like-me-line
words         : feeling; life; artwork; ask; question; dance
cross_subject : 
notes         : Tell a feeling a dance gives and link it to the child's life, look at an artwork and move to show what 
                is interesting in it, ask a question, and show a move from a dance watched or done. What changes: 
                first year, one feeling and one question. Assessed by a spoken line and a short movement, marked met, 
                partly or not yet. Teacher note: dances come from a source that says they are open to be shown. A 
                sacred or ceremonial work is used only when its source says it is open to be taught, and never as an 
                exercise, warm-up, costume or imitation; any cultural claim is checked against a source before a unit 
                names it.

strand        : da
grade         : 1
skill_id      : da-g1-connect
standard      : DA:Cn10.1.1a; DA:Cn10.1.1b; DA:Cn11.1.1a
assumes       : da-k-connect
hands_on      : da-g2-connect
model_in      : like-me-line
model_out     : like-me-line; dance-two-ties
words         : familiar; story; picture; big idea; culture; movement type
cross_subject : 
notes         : Find a familiar experience in a dance and name the moves that show it, dance the big ideas of a 
                picture-book story, and describe the moves of a dance from another culture. What changes: a story and 
                another culture are brought in. Assessed by a spoken tie to life, a short story movement and a 
                described or shown move from another culture's dance, scored on a three-line guide. Teacher note: a 
                dance from another culture is watched, or learned only if the community's own teaching says it is open 
                to be taught. A sacred or ceremonial work is used only when its source says it is open to be taught, 
                and never as an exercise, warm-up, costume or imitation; any cultural claim is checked against a 
                source before a unit names it.

strand        : da
grade         : 2
