model_out     : like-me-line; dance-two-ties
words         : relationship; compare; research; issue; culture; reveal
cross_subject : 
notes         : Compare relationships shown in a dance with the student's own, research a dance's view on an issue, 
                explore it in movement and share what was learned, and link a dance's moves to their culture and say 
                what they show. What changes: a first small piece of research feeds a movement piece, where grade 2 
                only answered set questions. Assessed by a shared piece of research movement and a written tie to 
                culture, scored on a short rubric. Teacher note: A sacred or ceremonial work is used only when its 
                source says it is open to be taught, and never as an exercise, warm-up, costume or imitation; any 
                cultural claim is checked against a source before a unit names it.




