docs/reviews/frame-visual-arts-grades-k-to-2-codex-2026-11-25.md:110:- **Unit 2:** Revisit the Hokusai work from unit 1 beside Kandinsky, with a short comparison of how line and color support different ideas.
docs/reviews/frame-visual-arts-grades-k-to-2-codex-2026-11-25.md:117:### 5. Unmarked process notes contradict completed work and understate current calendar coordination
docs/reviews/frame-visual-arts-grades-k-to-2-codex-2026-11-25.md:121:**REPEAT:** yes, stale script and planning-status notes were findings in `prework-arts-read-2026-11-19.md`.  
